	<font size="2" color="#FFFFFF" face="Verdana">
     Hi all I do not even remember my p####word or anything anyway I just wanted to let you all know that for now I will not be comming back on the game and I apologize for not letting you all know sooner it has been a rouge couple of months. Anyway perhaps one day I will return probably not for quite some time but when and if I do it will be at ground zero hehe. But I would like someone to email me as soon as possible I have a importent matter and it will help you all out tremendously so please email me as soon as you can ok well take care everyone I will miss you all.<br>         Sincerly your friend,<br>                  Caimen shadowsweepers<br>                  
	<p>
	caimen
	
	<br><a href="mailto:caimen21@yahoo.com">caimen21@yahoo.com</a>
	
